1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,687
The hardest part of trading usually isn't reading the chart.

2
00:00:04,055 --> 00:00:05,339
It's managing yourself.

3
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:10,096
Fear makes you sell at the bottom. Fear of missing out makes you buy the top.

4
00:00:10,444 --> 00:00:14,985
And after a loss, the urge to win it back fast leads to bigger, worse trades.

5
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:19,144
The fix is to decide your exits before you enter.

6
00:00:19,552 --> 00:00:29,575
On Meme Street you can set a take-profit and a stop-loss together with a one-click bracket, learn the psychology in the lessons, and feel your first losses with practice money.

7
00:00:30,075 --> 00:00:33,541
Practise the mental side of trading, at memestreet.net.

